      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the scholar Dr. Jakob Petuchowski’s translation of Alenu from his Shabbat Minḥah prayer-pamphlet (1966), p.15r-16r. The end of “She’hu noteh shamayim” and the beginning of “Al Ken” contain a revisionist (or “redemptive”) paraliturgical translation. I have set his translation side-by-side with the Hebrew with linear phrasing. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_38501_notes"/>
